            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CV i karta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cv, brief en wat je hebt gedaan, voor een sollicitatie.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CV, letter and what you've done, for an application."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CV, karta i loke bo a hasi, pa un solisitut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dan neemt Ayla dit mee in je vragen en zoekopdrachten. Je kunt het altijd weer uitzetten.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then Ayla includes this in your questions and searches. You can always turn it off again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anto Ayla ta tuma esaki den kuenta den bo preguntanan i búskedanan. Bo por pag'é atrobe semper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dat Ayla iets uit je kluis mag bekijken, betekent niet dat je het met anderen deelt. Delen doe je altijd hier, zelf.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ayla being allowed to view something from your vault doesn't mean you share it with others. You always share here, yourself."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ku Ayla mag wak algu for di bo kaha fuerte no ta nifiká ku bo ta kompartí esaki ku otro hende. Bo ta kompartí semper aki, bo mes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dat kan alleen op je iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That only works on your iPhone."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esei ta posibel solamente riba bo iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dat kon ik niet instellen: die keuze ken ik niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't set that: I don't know that option."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi no por a pone esei: mi no konosé e opshon ei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
