    "Deze lijst werkt zodra PAVE er klaar voor is. Je kunt hieronder wel alvast overal anders uitloggen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This list will work once PAVE is ready for it. You can already sign out everywhere else below."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E lista aki ta funshoná ora PAVE ta kla p'e. Bo por kaba di sali na tur otro kaminda aki bou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze mail heeft geen tekst voor Ayla.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This email has no text for Ayla."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E e-mail aki no tin teksto pa Ayla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze organisatie is niet bekend bij PAVE. Controleer de naam of neem contact op met je organisatie.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This organisation isn't known to PAVE. Check the name or contact your organisation."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE no ta konosé e organisashon aki. Kontrolá e nòmber òf tuma kontakto ku bo organisashon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze organisatie- of contactkeuze is niet meer geldig. Kies opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This organisation or contact choice is no longer valid. Choose again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E eskoho di organisashon òf kontakto aki no ta válido mas. Skohe atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze persoon mag dit soort bewijs niet bevestigen. Kies iemand anders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This person isn't allowed to confirm this type of evidence. Choose someone else."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E persona aki no mag konfirmá e tipo di prueba aki. Skohe un otro hende."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze pincode klopt niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This PIN is incorrect."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kódigo PIN aki no ta korekto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze regel blijft staan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This line stays."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E liña aki ta keda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze sollicitatie staat niet meer in je lijst.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This application is no longer in your list."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E solisitut aki no ta den bo lista mas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze week": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This week"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E siman aki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze werkgever kon niet worden geladen. Probeer het opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This employer couldn't be loaded. Try again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No por a karga e dunadó di trabou aki. Purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deze werkgeverssleutel klopt niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This employer key is incorrect."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E yabi di dunadó di trabou aki no ta korekto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die afbeelding kon niet bij je bewijs worden gezet. Kies een JPG of PNG.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That image couldn't be added to your evidence. Choose a JPG or PNG."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No por a pone e imágen ei na bo prueba. Skohe un JPG òf PNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die datum kon ik niet lezen. Zeg de dag nog eens, bijvoorbeeld 3 december.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't read that date. Say the day again, for example 3 December."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi no por a lesa e fecha ei. Bisa e dia di nobo, por ehempel 3 di desèmber."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diploma": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diploma"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diploma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diploma's": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomas"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomanan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diploma's en cijferlijsten die de school vraagt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomas and grade lists the school asks for"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diploma i lista di nota ku e skol ta pidi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diploma's in je kluis": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomas in your vault"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomanan den bo kaha fuerte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diploma's, certificaten en projecten, voor een opleiding.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diplomas, certificates and projects, for a programme."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diploma, sertifikado i proyekto, pa un estudio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct bij het bedrijf": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Directly at the company"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direktamente na e kompania"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This account"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kuenta aki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit antwoord steunt op": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This answer is based on"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kontesta aki ta basá riba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit apparaat": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E aparato aki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bericht is nagespeeld voor de demo; er is geen echte werkgever bij betrokken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This message was simulated for the demo; no real employer is involved."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E mensahe aki ta simulá pa e demo; no tin ningun dunadó di trabou di bèrdat envolví."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bericht is nagespeeld: er is geen echte werkgever bij betrokken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This message is simulated: no real employer is involved."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E mensahe aki ta simulá: no tin ningun dunadó di trabou di bèrdat involukrá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bericht verwijderen?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this message?"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kita e mensahe aki?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bestand is groter dan 20 MB. Kies een kleiner bestand.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file is larger than 20 MB. Choose a smaller file."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E archivo aki ta mas grandi ku 20 MB. Skohe un archivo mas chikí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bestand is leeg. Kies een ander bestand.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file is empty. Choose another file."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E archivo aki ta bashí. Skohe otro archivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bestand kan niet in je kluis. Kies een PDF, Word-bestand, tekst of foto tot 20 MB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file can't go in your vault. Choose a PDF, Word file, text or photo up to 20 MB."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E archivo aki no por drenta bo kaha fuerte. Skohe un PDF, archivo di Word, teksto òf foto te 20 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bewijs is bevestigd": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This evidence is confirmed"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E prueba aki ta konfirmá"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bewijs kan niet meer worden aangevraagd. Vernieuw de kluis en probeer opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This evidence can no longer be requested. Refresh the vault and try again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No por pidi e prueba aki mas. Refresk'á e kaha fuerte i purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit bewijsstuk is geverifieerd. Als je het aanvult, moet het opnieuw geverifieerd worden en vervalt het vinkje op je cv.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This evidence is verified. If you add to it, it has to be verified again and the tick on your CV disappears."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E prueba aki ta verifiká. Si bo kompletá e, e mester wòrdu verifiká atrobe i e marka riba bo CV ta disparsé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit e-mailadres klopt niet. Controleer het en probeer het opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This email address isn't valid. Check it and try again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E adrès di e-mail aki no ta korekto. Kontrol'é i purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit gedeelde profiel kan hier niet worden geopend. Open de link in je browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This shared profile can't be opened here. Open the link in your browser."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No por habri e perfil kompartí aki akinan. Habri e link den bo navegadó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit gesprek bestaat niet meer. Begin een nieuw gesprek.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation no longer exists. Start a new conversation."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kombersashon aki no ta eksistí mas. Kuminsá un kombersashon nobo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit gesprek hoort niet bij een project. Zeg in welk project het moet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation isn't part of a project. Say which project it should go in."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kombersashon aki no ta pertenesé na un proyekto. Bisa den ki proyekto e mester bai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit gesprek staat niet meer in de prullenmand van iCloud. Het is definitief verwijderd en kan niet meer terug.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation is no longer in the iCloud trash. It has been permanently deleted and can't be restored."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kombersashon aki no ta den e kashi di sushi di iCloud mas. E a wòrdu kitá pa semper i no por bini bèk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit gesprek staat nog niet in je lijst, dus dat lukt nu nog niet. Probeer het zo opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation isn't in your list yet, so that's not possible right now. Try again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E kombersashon aki no ta den bo lista ainda, p'esei esei no ta posibel awor. Purba atrobe den un ratu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit haalt het item en de bestanden erbij voorgoed uit je kluis, ook op het web. Dit kun je niet ongedaan maken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently removes the item and its files from your vault, on the web too. You can't undo this."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki ta kita e ítem i su archivonan pa semper for di bo kaha fuerte, tambe riba web. Bo no por deshasí esaki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit houd je zelf bij. PAVE stuurt niets naar het bedrijf.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You keep track of this yourself. PAVE doesn't send anything to the company."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo mes ta tene kuenta ku esaki. PAVE no ta manda nada pa e kompania."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit is een Hotmail- of Outlook-adres. PAVE werkt alleen met iCloud Mail: een @icloud.com-, @me.com- of @mac.com-adres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a Hotmail or Outlook address. PAVE only works with iCloud Mail: an @icloud.com, @me.com or @mac.com address."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki ta un adrès di Hotmail òf Outlook. PAVE ta funshoná solamente ku iCloud Mail: un adrès @icloud.com, @me.com òf @mac.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit is geen code van PAVE. Scan de QR-code op de stand of de poster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't a PAVE code. Scan the QR code on the stand or the poster."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki no ta un kódigo di PAVE. Skèn e kódigo QR na e stand òf riba e afiche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit is je huidige wachtwoord. Kies een ander wachtwoord.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is your current password. Choose a different password."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki ta bo kontraseña aktual. Skohe un otro kontraseña."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit is niet gelukt. Probeer het opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That didn't work. Try again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esei no a bai bon. Purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit is nog niet beschikbaar. Probeer het later nog een keer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't available yet. Try again later."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki no ta disponibel ainda. Purba atrobe mas despues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit komt beschikbaar zodra PAVE is bijgewerkt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will be available once PAVE is updated."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki lo ta disponibel ora PAVE ta aktualisá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit lijkt geen link. Controleer hem of laat het veld leeg.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This doesn't look like a link. Check it or leave the field empty."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki no ta parse un link. Kontrolá e òf laga e kampo bashí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit mag alleen na je tweestapsverificatie. Log opnieuw in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is only allowed after your two-step verification. Sign in again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki ta permití solamente despues di bo verifikashon den dos paso. Drenta atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit mag niet met dit account. Log opnieuw in en probeer het nog een keer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't allowed with this account. Sign in again and try once more."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esaki no ta permití ku e kuenta aki. Drenta atrobe i purba un biaha mas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit mag niet met je account. Log opnieuw in en probeer het nog een keer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This isn't allowed with your account. Sign in again and try once more."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
