            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Er bestaat al een account met dit e-mailadres. Log in, of kies 'Wachtwoord vergeten?' als je je wachtwoord kwijt bent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An account with this email address already exists. Sign in, or choose 'Forgot password?' if you've lost your password."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tin un kuenta kaba ku e adrès di e-mail aki. Drenta, òf skohe 'Lubidá kontraseña?' si bo a pèrdè bo kontraseña."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Er gaan geen bestanden mee. Ze zien alleen wat er over je bewijs staat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No files are included. They only see what's written about your evidence."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No tin archivo ta bai huntu. Nan ta mira solamente loke ta skirbí tokante bo prueba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Er ging iets mis bij je e-mailprovider. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
