    "Geverifieerd betekent: bevestigd door de organisatie zelf, in PAVE. Niet geverifieerd is zelf toegevoegd. Bestanden open je alleen zolang er gedeeld wordt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verified means: confirmed by the organisation itself, in PAVE. Not verified means added by the person themselves. You can only open files while it's being shared."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifiká ta nifiká: konfirmá pa e organisashon mes, den PAVE. No verifiká ta añadí pa e persona mes. Bo por habri archivonan solamente miéntras ku ta kompartiendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
