        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kambia e vensimentu no a bai bon. Purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier bewaar je straks je diploma's, certificaten, projecten en ervaringen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is where you will keep your diplomas, certificates, projects and experience."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki lo bo warda bo diplomanan, sertifikadonan, proyektonan i eksperensianan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier gaat geen bestand mee. Vraag het aan degene die dit deelde als je meer wilt zien.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No file is included here. Ask the person who shared this if you want to see more."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No tin archivo ta bai huntu aki. Puntra e persona ku a kompartí esaki si bo ke mira mas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier haal je het meest uit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is where you gain the most"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki bo ta gana mas tantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier liet je je kaartje achter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You left your card here"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki bo a laga bo karchi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier staat het scherm waar je op dat moment bent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This shows the screen you're on at that moment."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki ta e pantaya kaminda bo ta na e momentu ei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier staat nog niets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing here yet."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ainda no tin nada aki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier stel je straks een profiel samen om te delen, bijvoorbeeld voor een sollicitatie. Jij kiest wat erin staat en met wie je het deelt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is where you'll put together a profile to share, for example for an application. You choose what's in it and who you share it with."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki lo bo kompon un perfil pa kompartí, por ehèmpel pa un solisitut. Bo ta skohe kiko ta aden i ku ken bo ta kompartí e."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier verder": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue here"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigui aki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier zie je waar je met je PAVE-account bent ingelogd. Herken je een apparaat niet? Log het uit en wijzig je wachtwoord.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here you can see where you're signed in with your PAVE account. Don't recognise a device? Sign it out and change your password."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki bo ta mira unda bo ta drentá ku bo kuenta di PAVE. Bo no ta rekonosé un aparato? Saka e for di bo kuenta i kambia bo kontraseña."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier zie je wat je nu deelt, met wie en hoe lang nog.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here you can see what you're sharing now, with whom and for how long."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki bo ta mira kiko bo ta kompartiendo awor, ku ken i pa kuantu tempu mas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier zijn de vacatures.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here are the vacancies."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki ta e vakaturanan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hier zijn je bewaarde vacatures.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Here are your saved vacancies."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aki ta bo vakaturanan wardá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hiervoor gaat de tekst van dit gesprek naar Ayla, met de namen en adressen erin. Ze gebruikt hem alleen hiervoor; er komt geen chat van bij je chats. Ayla kan fouten maken, dus lees na wat ze schrijft.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For this, the text of this conversation goes to Ayla, including the names and addresses. She only uses it for this; it won't appear in your chats. Ayla can make mistakes, so check what she writes."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pa esaki, e teksto di e kombersashon aki ta bai na Ayla, ku e nòmbernan i adrèsnan aden. E ta us'é solamente pa esaki; e no ta bira un chat den bo chats. Ayla por kometé fayo, p'esei lesa kiko e ta skirbi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoe Ayla je noemt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What Ayla calls you"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kon Ayla ta yama bo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoe je wilt werken": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How you want to work"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kon bo ke traha"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoe kan ik %@ halen voor %@ bij %@?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How can I get %@ for %@ at %@?"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kon mi por haña %@ pa %@ na %@?"
          }
