            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ikono"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Iedere keer dat iemand iets opende wat je deelde, de afgelopen 30 dagen. Wat nog te zien is, stop je hier in één tik.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every time someone opened something you shared, in the last 30 days. Anything that can still be seen, you can stop here in one tap."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kada biaha ku un hende a habri algu ku bo a kompartí, den e último 30 dianan. Loke ainda por wòrdu mirá, bo ta stop aki ku un tok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Iets in de app doen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do something in the app"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
