    "Je doel scherp krijgen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sharpen your goal"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hasi bo meta mas kla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doet dit maar één keer: PAVE onthoudt het veilig op deze iPhone. Gebruik niet je gewone Apple-wachtwoord. Maak in je browser bij account.apple.com › Inloggen en beveiliging › App-specifieke wachtwoorden een nieuw wachtwoord voor PAVE en plak het hier.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You only do this once: PAVE remembers it securely on this iPhone. Don't use your regular Apple password. In your browser, go to account.apple.com › Sign-In and Security › App-Specific Passwords, create a new password for PAVE and paste it here."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta hasi esaki un biaha so: PAVE ta kòrda esaki na un manera sigur riba e iPhone aki. No usa bo kontraseña normal di Apple. Den bo navegadó, bai na account.apple.com › Sign-In and Security › App-Specific Passwords, traha un kontraseña nobo pa PAVE i pega e aki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je e-mail kon niet worden opgehaald. Controleer je internetverbinding en probeer opnieuw.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your email couldn't be fetched. Check your internet connection and try again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No por a buska bo e-mail. Kontrolá bo konekshon di internet i purba atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je e-mail ook hier?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your email here too?"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo e-mail aki tambe?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je e-mailadres of wachtwoord klopt niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your email address or password is incorrect."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo adrès di e-mail òf kontraseña no ta korekto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je e-mailadres of wachtwoord klopt niet. Probeer het opnieuw of kies 'Wachtwoord vergeten?'.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your email address or password is incorrect. Try again or choose 'Forgot password?'."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo adrès di e-mail òf kontraseña no ta korekto. Purba atrobe òf skohe 'Lubidá kontraseña?'."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je e-mails verschijnen bij je meldingen. Je kunt ze daar lezen en beantwoorden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your emails appear with your notifications. You can read and reply to them there."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo e-mailnan ta aparesé serka bo notifikashonnan. Einan bo por lesa i kontestá nan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je eigen foto in de band boven je kaart": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
