            "value": "Bo kombersashonnan ku Ayla ta aparesé aki, tambe esnan ku bo kuminsá riba web òf bo Apple Watch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je hebt al een map met deze naam. Kies een andere naam.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You already have a folder with this name. Choose another name."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo tin un fòlder ku e nòmber aki kaba. Skohe otro nòmber."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je hebt de aanvraag afgewezen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've rejected the request."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo a rechasá e petishon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je hebt gedeeld met %@. Dit houd je zelf bij; PAVE stuurt niets naar het bedrijf.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You shared with %@. You keep track of this yourself; PAVE doesn't send anything to the company."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo a kompartí ku %@. Bo mes ta tene kuenta ku esaki; PAVE no ta manda nada pa e kompania."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je hebt geen bewijsstukken in je archief": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have no evidence in your archive"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo no tin prueba den bo archivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je hebt geen chats in je archief": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
