          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password doesn't meet all the requirements yet."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo kontraseña no ta kumpli ku tur rekisito ainda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je werkt als leidinggevende bij de Plus.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You work as a manager at Plus."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta traha komo gerente na Plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je werkt bij Albert Heijn.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You work at Albert Heijn."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta traha na Albert Heijn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je wordt uitgelogd. Log opnieuw in met je wachtwoord en verificatiecode en kies daarna een nieuwe pincode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll be signed out. Sign in again with your password and verification code, then choose a new PIN."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta sali for di bo kuenta. Drenta atrobe ku bo kontraseña i kódigo di verifikashon i despues skohe un kódigo PIN nobo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ziet alleen gesprekken met mensen die je eerder mailde of die in je contacten staan. Nieuwsbrieven en automatische berichten komen er niet in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You only see conversations with people you've emailed before or who are in your contacts. Newsletters and automated messages aren't included."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta mira solamente kombersashonnan ku hende ku bo a manda e-mail promé òf ku ta den bo kontaktonan. Nieuwsbrief i mensahenan outomátiko no ta drenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ziet en wist alles wat Ayla onthoudt in Instellingen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can see and erase everything Ayla remembers in Settings."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo por mira i borá tur loke Ayla ta kòrda na Konfigurashon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ziet het ook als PAVE dicht is. Alleen de titel, nooit je bewijs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll see it even when PAVE is closed. Only the title, never your evidence."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta mir'é tambe ora PAVE ta sirá. Solamente e título, nunka bo prueba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ziet wanneer iemand kijkt, en je kunt het altijd pauzeren of intrekken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You see when someone looks, and you can always pause or revoke it."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta mira ora un hende wak, i bo por pousa òf retir'é semper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jij": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jij bepaalt wat je deelt, met wie en hoe lang. Je kunt het altijd pauzeren of intrekken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You decide what you share, with whom and for how long. You can always pause or revoke it."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bo ta disidí kiko bo ta kompartí, ku ken i pa kuantu tempu. Bo por pousa òf retir'é semper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jij: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You: %@"
          }
        },
