    "Ontdek kansen, krijg persoonlijk advies en werk met AI direct in jouw PAVE-omgeving. Van je kluis en ontwikkelplan tot vacatures en sollicitaties.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discover opportunities, get personal advice and work with AI right in your PAVE environment. From your vault and development plan to vacancies and applications."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deskubrí oportunidatnan, haña konseho personal i traha ku AI direktamente den bo ambiente di PAVE. Di bo kaha fuerte i plan di desaroyo te vakaturanan i solisitutnan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
