    "Over de %@ vacatures die je vond, bewaarde of waarop je solliciteert: wat ze vragen, wat je al kunt laten zien en wat je nog mist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About the %@ vacancies you found, saved or are applying for: what they ask for, what you can already show and what you're still missing."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokante e %@ vakaturanan ku bo a haña, warda òf ta solisitá pa nan: kiko nan ta pidi, kiko bo por mustra kaba i kiko ainda ta falta bo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over de vacature die je vond, bewaarde of waarop je solliciteert: wat ze vragen, wat je al kunt laten zien en wat je nog mist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About the vacancy you found, saved or are applying for: what it asks for, what you can already show and what you're still missing."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokante e vakatura ku bo a haña, warda òf ta solisitá pa dje: kiko e ta pidi, kiko bo por mustra kaba i kiko ainda ta falta bo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
