    "Overstappen naar werk dat beter bij me past.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching to work that suits me better."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kambia pa trabou ku ta kuadra mihó ku mi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE haalt je e-mail live op bij je provider en bewaart die niet op een server. Je inloggegevens staan alleen in de sleutelhanger van deze iPhone en blijven daar tot je ontkoppelt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE fetches your email live from your provider and doesn't store it on a server. Your login details are only in this iPhone's keychain and stay there until you disconnect."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta buska bo e-mail en bibo serka bo proveedor i no ta warda e riba un server. Bo datonan di login ta solamente den e keychain di e iPhone aki i ta keda einan te ora bo deskonektá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE is een prototype van een Fontys-studententeam voor Npuls en SURF, geen bestaand product. Gebruik voorbeeldgegevens, geen echte persoonsgegevens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE is a prototype by a Fontys student team for Npuls and SURF, not an existing product. Use example data, not real personal data."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta un prototipo di un tim di studiante di Fontys pa Npuls i SURF, no un produkto eksistente. Usa datonan di ehèmpel, no datonan personal di bèrdat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE is nu donker.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE is now dark."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta skur awor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE is nu licht.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE is now light."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta kla awor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE mag de camera niet gebruiken. Zet het aan in Instellingen › PAVE › Camera.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE isn't allowed to use the camera. Turn it on in Settings › PAVE › Camera."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE no mag usa e kámara. Pon'é na Konfigurashon › PAVE › Kámara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE mag niet in je contacten kijken. Je kunt dat aanzetten in de Instellingen van je iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE isn't allowed to look at your contacts. You can turn that on in your iPhone's Settings."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE no mag wak den bo kontaktonan. Bo por pone esei na Konfigurashon di bo iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE verandert meteen van taal. Ayla antwoordt in de taal waarin je haar schrijft. Wat je zelf hebt gemaakt, zoals je chats en je kluis, blijft zoals het is.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE changes language right away. Ayla answers in the language you write to her in. What you made yourself, like your chats and your vault, stays as it is."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta kambia di idioma mesora. Ayla ta kontestá den e idioma ku bo ta skirbi su. Loke bo mes a traha, manera bo chats i bo kaha fuerte, ta keda manera e ta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE vergeet je wachtwoord. Je e-mails blijven gewoon in je mailbox. Trek het app-specifieke wachtwoord ook in bij account.apple.com als je het niet meer gebruikt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE forgets your password. Your emails stay in your mailbox. Also revoke the app-specific password at account.apple.com if you no longer use it."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta lubidá bo kontraseña. Bo e-mailnan ta keda den bo mailbox. Retirá e kontraseña spesífiko pa app tambe na account.apple.com si bo no ta us'é mas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PAVE volgt nu de instelling van je apparaat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE now follows your device's setting."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PAVE ta sigui e konfigurashon di bo aparato awor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
