            "value": "Tap Apply on a vacancy, or create one yourself. This is where you keep track of how it's going."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tok riba Solisitá na un vakatura, òf traha bo mes un. Aki bo ta tene kuenta kon e ta bayendo."
