    "Vertel in een halve minuut wie je bent. Het wordt tekst die je kunt aanpassen; de opname zelf wordt niet bewaard.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tell who you are in half a minute. It becomes text you can edit; the recording itself isn't kept."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konta den mei minüt ken bo ta. E ta bira teksto ku bo por kambia; e grabashon mes no ta wòrdu wardá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertel je Ayla iets over %@, dan vraagt ze of ze het hier mag bewaren. Je kunt ook zelf iets toevoegen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you tell Ayla something about %@, she'll ask whether she can keep it here. You can also add something yourself."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si bo konta Ayla algu tokante %@, e ta puntra si e por warda esaki aki. Bo por añadí algu bo mes tambe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertel meer over %@ bij %@: waarom past die bij mij, en wat mis ik nog?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tell me more about %@ at %@: why does it suit me, and what am I still missing?"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konta mi mas tokante %@ na %@: dikon e ta kuadra ku mi, i kiko ainda ta falta mi?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertel verder en Ayla vult het aan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
