            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you archive disappears from view, but is kept until you restore or delete it. You can't share archived evidence."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loke bo archivá ta disparsé for di bista, pero ta keda wardá te ora bo pone e bèk òf kit'é. Bo no por kompartí prueba archivá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
