            "value": "Pone bo sertifikado den bo kaha fuerte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet je diploma's en cijferlijsten in je kluis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put your diplomas and grade lists in your vault."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone bo diplomanan i lista di nota den bo kaha fuerte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet je dit aan, dan kan de ontvanger je cv en brief als pdf bewaren. Bewaren kun je daarna niet meer terugdraaien. Staat het uit, dan kan de ontvanger alleen kijken; helemaal tegenhouden dat iemand een schermafbeelding maakt, kan geen enkele app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you turn this on, the recipient can save your CV and letter as PDF. You can't undo saving afterwards. If it's off, the recipient can only view; no app can fully prevent someone from taking a screenshot."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si bo pone esaki, e risibidó por warda bo CV i karta komo PDF. Despues bo no por deshasí e wardamentu. Si e ta pagá, e risibidó por wak solamente; ningun app por stop kompletamente ku un hende saka un screenshot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet je opleiding en wat je al kunt in je profiel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put your studies and what you can already do in your profile."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone bo estudio i loke bo por kaba den bo perfil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet je sollicitatie op Verstuurd?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set your application to Sent?"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone bo solisitut riba Mandá?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet snel ontgrendelen aan voor PAVE": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on quick unlock for PAVE"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone desbloká rápido na PAVE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet ze aan in de Instellingen van je iPhone, anders ziet PAVE ze niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn them on in your iPhone's Settings, otherwise PAVE doesn't see them."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone nan na Konfigurashon di bo iPhone, sino PAVE no ta mira nan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zet ze aan in de Instellingen van je iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn them on in your iPhone's Settings."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pone nan na Konfigurashon di bo iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo gaan we met je gegevens om": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How we handle your data"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kon nos ta trata bo datonan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo haal je je doel beter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A better way to your goal"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina bo ta logra bo meta mihó"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo kun je het zeggen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How you could say it"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina bo por bis'é"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo opent je kluis. In de kluis kun je even wisselen; de volgende keer opent hij weer zo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how your vault opens. You can switch inside the vault for a moment; next time it opens like this again."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina bo kaha fuerte ta habri. Den e kaha fuerte bo por kambia un ratu; e siguiente biaha e ta habri asina atrobe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo veel vacatures zijn er niet. Er zijn er %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There aren't that many vacancies. There are %@."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No tin asina tantu vakatura. Tin %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo ziet de ontvanger het": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how the recipient sees it"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina e risibidó ta mir'é"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo ziet de werkgever wie er bij de stand solliciteerde. Hier speelt een medespeler de recruiter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how the employer sees who applied at the stand. Here, a fellow player plays the recruiter."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina e dunadó di trabou ta mira ken a solisitá na e stand. Aki, un kompañero ta hunga e rekrutadó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo ziet de werkgever wie er bij de stand solliciteerde. In de demo speelt een medespeler de recruiter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how the employer sees who applied at the stand. In the demo, a fellow player plays the recruiter."
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina e dunadó di trabou ta mira ken a solisitá na e stand. Den e demo, un kompañero ta hunga e rekrutadó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zo ziet je kaart eruit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how your card looks"
          }
        },
        "pap": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asina bo karchi ta parse"
          }
